1
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:27,000
It's Another 'Four Daughters' Hit! And they're gayer than
ever, sweeter than ever, better than ever before!

2
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Daughters Courageous is a drama, romance film directed by Michael Curtiz.

3
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:09,000
Nan Masters, a single mother living with her four marriageable
daughters, plans to marry Sam Sloane, businessman.

4
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:30,000
Out of the blue her first husband Jim returns after
deserting the family 20 years earlier.

5
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:51,000
The worldly wanderer Jim gets a cool family reception at first but his warm
personality gradually wins the affections of his four daughters.

6
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:12,000
In fact, youngest daughter Buff, who has her eye on a maverick of her own in Gabriel
Lopez, is pleased when Jim grants his stamp of approval on her relationship.

7
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:33,000
Buff plans to elope with Gabriel on her mother's wedding day,
but 'unpredictable' is Gabriel's middle name.

8
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:54,000
Gabriel Lopez, played by John Garfield.

9
00:48:09,000 --> 00:48:15,000
Jim Masters, played by Claude Rains.

10
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:36,000
John S. 'Johnny' Heming, played by Jeffrey Lynn.

11
00:58:51,000 --> 00:58:57,000
Nancy 'Nan' Masters, played by Fay Bainter.

12
01:04:12,000 --> 01:04:18,000
Samuel 'Sam' Sloane, played by Donald Crisp.

13
01:09:33,000 --> 01:09:39,000
Penny, the Housekeeper, played by May Robson.

14
01:14:54,000 --> 01:15:00,000
Daughters Courageous is a 1939 American drama film starring John Garfield, Claude Rains,
Jeffrey Lynn and featuring the Lane Sisters: Lola, Rosemary and Priscilla.

15
01:20:15,000 --> 01:20:21,000
Based on the play Fly Away Home by Dorothy Bennett and Irving
White, the film was directed by Michael Curtiz.

16
01:25:36,000 --> 01:25:42,000
It was released by Warner Bros.

17
01:30:57,000 --> 01:31:03,000
on June 23, 1939.

18
01:36:18,000 --> 01:36:24,000
The film explores themes of sibling relationship, ex husband,
family relationships, wedding, single mother.

19
01:41:39,000 --> 01:41:45,000
The tone is emotional.
